{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10198","headline":"自苏台至望亭驿人家尽空春物增思怅然有作因寄从弟纾 · 李嘉佑","name":"自苏台至望亭驿人家尽空春物增思怅然有作因寄从弟纾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南浦菰蒋覆白苹，东吴黎庶逐黄巾。\n野棠自发空临水，江燕初归不见人。\n远岫依依如送客，平田渺渺独伤春。\n那堪回首长洲苑，烽火年年报虏尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}